/*
 * Blinky overlay for nRF52840-DK
 *
 * No modifications needed — the DK board file already defines the
 * led0 alias pointing to LED1 (P0.13, active-low).
 * This overlay is intentionally empty but kept for completeness and
 * to document the hardware assignment.
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   LED0 → P0.13 (green, active-low, on-board)
 */
